# Repository Memory Compatibility Adapter

## Purpose

Preserve the former repository-memory workflow while routing active lifecycle and append-only rules through the canonical `.agent/` contract.

## Activation

Consult when reconciling historical Digital Cell memory instructions with the current Authority governance skill.

## Non-applicability

Do not treat this adapter as a second governance contract or as permission to rewrite append-only history.

## Fallback

Use `.agent/PROJECT_GOAL.md`, `.agent/PROJECT_PROFILE.md`, `.agent/CURRENT.md`, and the canonical Authority governance skill.

## Control status

This is an advisory compatibility adapter; the canonical Authority contract is authoritative.
